{
  "duration": 42.519,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 1.279,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.819,
      "end": 2.98,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.379,
      "end": 5.339,
      "text": "Now, in this problem, we are given that a boat"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.779,
      "end": 8.619,
      "text": "travels sixty kilometer downstream at a speed of"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.159,
      "end": 10.639,
      "text": "fifteen kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.239,
      "end": 13.259,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the time taken."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.899,
      "end": 16.659,
      "text": "This is a direct formula-based question."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.219,
      "end": 18.479,
      "text": "We already know the distance."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.92,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "We also know the speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.459,
      "end": 22.519,
      "text": "So we can directly use the basic formula,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.1,
      "end": 25.299,
      "text": "time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.699,
      "end": 27.119,
      "text": "Now, let us put the given values."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.579,
      "end": 29.619,
      "text": "Time is equal to sixty"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 31.019,
      "text": "divided by fifteen."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.579,
      "end": 32.739,
      "text": "After simplifying this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.159,
      "end": 34.04,
      "text": "we get four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.419,
      "end": 34.859,
      "text": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.54,
      "end": 36.159,
      "text": "Very simple."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.559,
      "end": 39.739,
      "text": "So the boat takes four hours to travel sixty kilometer downstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.139,
      "end": 42.519,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option B."
    }
  ],
